				"readmeComment": "Start cleaning sends the room cleaning command of the Mi Home app without rooms (whole area); it also resumes a paused run. Point and zone cleaning: write `target-point` or `zone-points` first, then send the start action. Save, replace or discard the new map is the answer to the new map question of the app (see `has-newmap`). Create a new map, Clean rooms in order and the voice pack download exist on newer models and firmware only. Map editing (rooms, virtual walls, restricted areas), saved map selection, schedules and voice pack download need several inputs and are not available. Value mapping `[\"start-sweep\"\u003d\"Start cleaning\",\"start-sweep-walls\"\u003d\"Start cleaning along walls\",\"stop-sweeping\"\u003d\"Stop cleaning\",\"pause\"\u003d\"Pause cleaning\",\"start-charge\"\u003d\"Go to dock\",\"stop-charge\"\u003d\"Stop returning to dock\",\"find-device\"\u003d\"Locate the robot\",\"start-point-clean\"\u003d\"Start point cleaning\",\"pause-point-clean\"\u003d\"Pause point cleaning\",\"start-zone-clean\"\u003d\"Start zone cleaning\",\"pause-zone-clean\"\u003d\"Pause zone cleaning\",\"save-new-map\"\u003d\"Save the new map\",\"replace-saved-map\"\u003d\"Replace the saved map with the new map\",\"discard-new-map\"\u003d\"Discard the new map\",\"create-new-map\"\u003d\"Create a new map\",\"reset-side-brush\"\u003d\"Reset side brush life\",\"reset-main-brush\"\u003d\"Reset main brush life\",\"reset-dust-filter\"\u003d\"Reset dust box filter life\",\"reset-map\"\u003d\"Clear the saved map\",\"set-calibration\"\u003d\"Calibrate\"]`"
			},
